stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> RequestReceived

    RequestReceived --> Rejected: invalid signature or payload
    RequestReceived --> KeyDerived: valid signed request

    KeyDerived --> ExistingKey: idempotency key found
    KeyDerived --> NewKey: idempotency key absent

    ExistingKey --> ReplayReturned: stored payload matches
    ExistingKey --> ConflictReturned: stored payload differs

    NewKey --> SlotRejected: slot missing or occupied
    NewKey --> AppointmentCommitted: slot open and transaction commits

    AppointmentCommitted --> ResponseDelayed: Failure Lab enabled for first attempt
    AppointmentCommitted --> CreatedReturned: normal mode

    ResponseDelayed --> RetellTimedOut: delay exceeds configured timeout
    RetellTimedOut --> RequestReceived: Retell retries

    ReplayReturned --> [*]
    ConflictReturned --> [*]
    SlotRejected --> [*]
    CreatedReturned --> [*]
    Rejected --> [*]

    note right of AppointmentCommitted
        Database invariants:
        one row per idempotency key
        one active appointment per slot
    end note

    note right of ReplayReturned
        The replay returns the original
        appointment ID without another insert.
    end note
